{"title": "Two Earthquakes Strike Ladakh Region", "summary": "Two earthquakes, measuring 5.5 and 4.3 magnitudes, struck Ladakh within a four-hour period. The stronger tremor registered 5.5 magnitude, followed by a 4.3 magnitude quake. The events occurred in the Ladakh region, with one report specifying Leh as the affected area.", "summary_points": ["Two earthquakes occurred in Ladakh.", "The first earthquake measured 5.5 magnitude.", "The second earthquake measured 4.3 magnitude.", "The two quakes occurred within a four-hour span.", "One report specified Leh as the location."], "title_hi": "लद्दाख क्षेत्र में दो भूकंप आए", "summary_hi": "5.5 और 4.3 तीव्रता के दो भूकंप चार घंटे की अवधि के भीतर लद्दाख में आए। पहले तेज भूकंप की तीव्रता 5.5 मापी गई, जिसके बाद 4.3 तीव्रता का भूकंप आया। ये घटनाएं लद्दाख क्षेत्र में हुईं, जिसमें एक रिपोर्ट में लेह को प्रभावित क्षेत्र बताया गया है।", "summary_points_hi": ["लद्दाख में दो भूकंप आए।", "पहले भूकंप की तीव्रता 5.5 मापी गई।", "दूसरे भूकंप की तीव्रता 4.3 मापी गई।", "दोनों भूकंप चार घंटे के भीतर आए।", "एक रिपोर्ट में लेह को स्थान बताया गया।"], "framing": {"center": ["Reported the magnitudes of the two earthquakes as 5.5 and 4.3.", "Stated the earthquakes occurred within a four-hour period in Ladakh.", "Mentioned Leh as the specific location affected by the tremors."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["दो भूकंपों की तीव्रता 5.5 और 4.3 बताई गई।", "कहा गया कि भूकंप लद्दाख में चार घंटे की अवधि के भीतर आए।", "भूकंप से प्रभावित विशिष्ट स्थान के रूप में लेह का उल्लेख किया गया।"]}, "topic": "Environment", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/ladakh/two-moderate-intensity-earthquakes-hit-ladakh-within-four-hours/article71339828.ece", "headline": "Two moderate-intensity earthquakes hit Ladakh within four hours"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language